= Picard 3.0 released
[Development] Posted Oct 5, 2026 13:21 UTC (Mon) by jzb
[97]Version 3.0 of the [98]MusicBrainz Picard tag editor
has been released. "This release brings many changes,
including an upgrade to Qt6, a completely new plugin
system, several improvements to the user interface, cover
art processing, [[99]International Standard Recording Code
(ISRC)] submission and many more." 
LWN [100]covered Picard in April.
